# PNG masters and print-bleed fronts stay local — the committed archive of every
# card is cards/art/*.jpg (q95, 4:4:4), which the tools fall back to when the
# .png master is absent. A fresh clone can rebuild print/fronts from the JPEGs.
cards/art/*.png
print/fronts/
# The Burning Man API snapshot stays local. Burning Man's API terms embargo
# public display of placement data — art until gates open, camps until the
# Sunday before the event — and this repo is public. Rebuild it any time with
# `python3 tools/fetch_brc.py`.
data/brc_*_snapshot.json

# Ephemera
server.log
app/receipts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
app/models/
app/state/

# Local style tests / generation scratch
.scratch/
